    "sections": {
        "description": "Squadeno is a fast, accessible theme for sports clubs, associations and teams — football, handball, gymnastics, swimming, or a club with many sports under one roof. A hero slider, front page tiles, latest news and an optional sidebar are all set up in the Customizer; your brand colours drive the whole design, and the block editor mirrors it, wide and full-width blocks included. No external fonts, scripts or third-party requests, so it stays quick and privacy-friendly. Works on its own, and pairs with the free Club Sports Manager plugin for sports, training times, coaches, venues and an event calendar; tiles can link to its entries."
    },
